{{!
    @template tool_vae/dossier_claim

    One declaration of the dossier, in its block: the warning of its anchor, its state, the notes of a carry-over, the
    declaration, the attestations under their heading, the chronology, the ways on the attestation and the carry-over, the
    link of the questions, the link of the pieces with the badge of those added after the signature. On logical lines: a
    comment carries each line break of the template, so that no space is drawn where the old code wrote none.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\dossier_claim. The template holds no logic beyond its
    sections. Every text, label and address is escaped (double braces). Keys placed as they are (triple braces):
    warninghtml, statehtml, noteshtml, declarationhtml, attestationshtml, chronologyhtml, drawn by the templates of
    tool_vae (anchor_warning, state_label, carry_notes, declaration, attestations, chronology); acthtml, a notification or a
    button of the core.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * warninghtml, statehtml, noteshtml, declarationhtml, attestationshtml, chronologyhtml - string, HTML of the pieces
    * heading - string, the heading of the attestations
    * acts - array, each {acthtml}: a notification or a button, in their order
    * precision - {url, label}: the link of the questions
    * pieces - null, or {url, label, late}: the link of the pieces, late null or {label}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "warninghtml": "",
        "statehtml": "<span class=\"badge bg-secondary\">Declared</span>",
        "noteshtml": "",
        "declarationhtml": "<div class=\"tool-vae-declaration\">RNCP100-C01</div>",
        "heading": "Attestation",
        "attestationshtml": "<p>No attestation yet.</p>",
        "chronologyhtml": "<ol><li>Declared</li></ol>",
        "acts": [{"acthtml": "<div class=\"singlebutton\"><button type=\"submit\">Attest</button></div>"}],
        "precision": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/precision.php?evidenceid=4",
            "label": "Questions on this declaration"},
        "pieces": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/piece.php?evidenceid=4", "label": "Supporting pieces (2)",
            "late": {"label": "1 added after the signature"} }
    }
}}
<section class="tool-vae-claim-block mb-4">{{{warninghtml}}}<p>{{{statehtml}}}</p>{{{noteshtml}}}{{{declarationhtml}}}{{!
}}<h3>{{heading}}</h3>{{{attestationshtml}}}{{{chronologyhtml}}}{{#acts}}{{{acthtml}}}{{/acts}}{{!
}}{{#precision}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>{{/precision}}{{!
}}{{#pieces}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{!
}}{{#late}} <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">{{label}}</span>{{/late}}</p>{{/pieces}}{{!
}}</section>
